<!-- ── THE PLEDGE ── -->
<section class="section">
  <div class="wrap pledge-wrap">

    <p class="pledge-preamble">“AI is part of everyday life — in school, work, and creativity. This pledge is not rules handed down to you. It’s the values you choose when you use powerful tools. Here are seven principles for using this technology thoughtfully.<span class="pledge-preamble__close">Powerful tools require thoughtful people.”</span></p>

    <div class="principles">
      <div class="principle">
        <div class="principle__num">01</div>
        <div>
          <h2 class="principle__title">People Lead, AI Follows</h2>
          <p class="principle__body">You are always the author. Use AI to expand what you can do — not to replace your thinking, your judgment, or your voice. If you stop questioning what AI gives you, you’re letting it make decisions for you.</p>
        </div>
      </div>
      <div class="principle">
        <div class="principle__num">02</div>
        <div>
          <h2 class="principle__title">Be Honest About What’s AI</h2>
          <p class="principle__body">If AI made it, say so. A voice, an image, a recommendation — don’t present AI-generated work as purely your own. Trust between people is fragile and hard to rebuild. Protect it like it matters, because it does.</p>
        </div>
      </div>
      <div class="principle">
        <div class="principle__num">03</div>
        <div>
          <h2 class="principle__title">Guard What’s Private</h2>
          <p class="principle__body">Before you share, pause. Personal information deserves more protection than most people give it. If something feels like more than you should be sharing, trust that instinct. Share less than you think you need to. Protect more than you think you have to.</p>
        </div>
      </div>
      <div class="principle">
        <div class="principle__num">04</div>
        <div>
          <h2 class="principle__title">Watch for What’s Unfair</h2>
          <p class="principle__body">AI learns from the past — and the past wasn’t always fair. Bias gets built into algorithms quietly, showing up in who gets flagged, recommended, or left out. Stay curious. Ask questions. Make sure the tools you use treat everyone the same way.</p>
        </div>
      </div>
      <div class="principle">
        <div class="principle__num">05</div>
        <div>
          <h2 class="principle__title">Think About Real People</h2>
          <p class="principle__body">Whether you’re creating with AI or just using it, what you put out affects real people — your neighbors, your community, your family. Before you post, share, or publish, ask: does this actually help? Or does it just add more noise?</p>
        </div>
      </div>
      <div class="principle">
        <div class="principle__num">06</div>
        <div>
          <h2 class="principle__title">Share What You Learn</h2>
          <p class="principle__body">Nobody has AI figured out. We’re all discovering its strengths, limits, and risks in real time. Share what you find — the wins, the surprises, the things that didn’t work. Those experiences help all of us grow wiser together.</p>
        </div>
      </div>
      <div class="principle">
        <div class="principle__num">07</div>
        <div>
          <h2 class="principle__title">Stay Human</h2>
          <p class="principle__body">AI can be a collaborator and sounding board — but it cannot be you. It doesn’t know you; it reflects you. Real connection, real friendship, real belonging still come from other people. Use AI to expand your humanity, not to replace it.</p>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>

    <!-- Signing. No form and no backend by design: the printed sheet is
         the artifact. These lines are real markup so they print. -->
    <div class="pledge-sign">
      <h2 class="h2">Sign the Pledge</h2>
      <p class="pledge-sign__intro">These are principles I hold for myself.</p>
      <div class="sign-lines">
        <div class="sign-line"><span class="sign-line__label">Name / Signature</span></div>
        <div class="sign-line"><span class="sign-line__label">Date</span></div>
      </div>
      <p class="pledge-print-hint">Print this page to sign it — it lays out clean on one sheet.</p>
    </div>

    <div class="pledge-mantra"><span>Read it.</span><span>Sign it.</span><span>Breathe it.</span><span>Share it.</span></div>
    <p class="pledge-final">The most important things about you cannot be generated.</p>

    <p class="pledge-workshop">AICV runs workshops on responsible AI for companies, schools, and organizations across the Coachella Valley — <a href="/">aicoachellavalley.org</a>.</p>

